    "description": "Fantastic opportunity in prime Presidio Heights! This two-unit property was home to one family over the past five decades and now is ready for its next owner. Built at the turn of the century, period details abound including high ceilings, decorative fireplaces, moldings, bay windows, and more. On the main level is a lower flat with a bright formal living room, two expansive bedrooms, an office or third bedroom, a split bathroom with a shower, and a formal dining room. The eat-in kitchen adjoins a laundry room with direct access to the large, level garden. The upper-level flat houses a formal living room with bay window, three bedrooms plus an office, and a split bath with a shower over a tub. The eat-in kitchen boasts an attached sunny breakfast room and stairs down to the lovely garden. On the basement level is a one-car garage plus additional storage. Newly painted exterior and newer roof. Endless possibilities as a family compound, owner's unit with tenant income, condo conversion, or investment property. The location is everything: blocks from the Presidio Golf Course and trail entrance, with Sacramento St shops, Clement St restaurants and California St conveniences around the corner. Bring your architect/contractor and transform this canvas into your dream home."
  },
